    "establishes": "The court's own record, and the first primary document in this archive for the Delhi proceeding. What it establishes: the cause title, the writ petition and application numbers, the date of listing, and the bench. It settles two things the news reports disagreed about: the cause title is Shakeel Abbas v. Union of India and Ors. as Verdictum reported, and the date is 22 July 2026; reports giving the 23rd are mistaken. What it does not establish: anything at all about what was ordered. A cause list records that a matter was listed and before whom. The directions at PROC-DEL-001 still rest on news reports and stay CORROBORATED until the order itself is held. Retrieval: the file is 21MB and its sha256 is recorded above. Delhi High Court cause lists are directly downloadable at delhihighcourt.nic.in/files/YYYY-MM/cause-list/ as combined_cause_list_DD.MM.YYYY.pdf, and per-court lists as rlDDMMYYYY.pdf. The earlier guess of c_DDMMYYYY.pdf is the format for some dates but not this one.",
